{"type":"proposition","type_name":"Proposition","number":"34.5.3","title":"The three statistics","title_html":"The three statistics","html":"<p>Define <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Wald}&=(\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{\\top}\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}})^{\\top}\\bigl(\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{\\top}\\hat{\\mathbf{A}}_n^{-1}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}\\bigr)^{-1}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}^{\\top}\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}},\\\\\n\\text{Score}&=\\mathbf{U}(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}})^{\\top}\\boldsymbol{\\mathcal\nI}_n(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}})^{-1}\\mathbf{U}(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}}),\\\\\n\\text{LR}&=2\\bigl\\{\\ell(\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}})-\\ell(\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}})\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 15.327em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0; padding-bottom: 0.15em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c57\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0; padding-bottom: 0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6B2 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.26